msgid "Small-scale simulator example {#small-scale-simulator-example}"
msgstr "Przykład w małej skali na symulatorze {#small-scale-simulator-example}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Start with a system small enough to compute everything exactly: the depth-one kicked-Ising state on eight qubits, with 12% local depolarizing noise to model the hardware. Because the noisy state is known, you can compare the learned model with it directly.\n"
